Name: sasl_pwcheck_method
Type: BITFIELD
Allowed-Values: alwaystrue auxprop saslauthd
Default-Value: saslauthd
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED
For-Documentation-Only: 1
SASL-Option: pwcheck_method

The method used by the server to verify plaintext passwords.

alwaystrue
  Accepts any username/password combination.  Mostly only useful for testing
  things.
auxprop
  Validates the username and password combination using the configured
  :imapdconf:`sasl_auxprop_plugin`.  But there are no auxprop plugins, so this
  is not useful.
saslauthd
  Validates the username and password combination using the saslauthd service
  specified by :imapdconf:`sasl_saslauthd_path`.
